---
import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-astro';
import Section from '../common/Section.astro';
import Button from '../common/Button.astro';
---

<Section id="farm-overview" surface="surface" compact={true} class="border-b border-[#43563A]/8">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
    <div class="space-y-2 lg:col-span-4">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#F4FBE9] px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#438C38] ring-1 ring-[#63A83E]/25">
        Theni Livestock &amp; Farm Produce
      </span>
      <h2 class="m-0 font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#43563A]">
        What MSV Goat Farm Does in Theni
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3 lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#58684C]">
        Situated in a rural hillside compound in Theni, Tamil Nadu, MSV Goat Farm houses goats inside
        an elevated slatted-floor shed designed for natural cross-ventilation and organised aisle feeding.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#58684C]">
        Customers in and around Theni can review our livestock housing, learn about goat selection,
        traditional dried goat meat (<span lang="ta">உப்புக்கண்டம்</span>), and goat milk
        characteristics, and speak directly with the farm owner regarding current availability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 lg:col-span-3 lg:justify-end">
      <Button href="/about/" variant="secondary">
        <span>Explore Farm Setup</span>
        <ArrowRight class="size-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
      </Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

